«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  UShapeCDF
  @  Distribution function at X.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 3; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 3 ≠ THEN "UShapeCDF: needs 3 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → Xminv Xmaxv Xv « Xminv 0 + Xmaxv 0 + Xv 0 + → Xmin Xmax X « 'IFTE(X≤Xmin;0;IFTE(X≥Xmax;1;4*UVAL(UBASE(ASIN(√((X-Xmin)/(Xmax-Xmin)))))))' →Num Xminv Xmaxv Xv 3 →List Drop » »
»
